// Name :
"P1028011008" "Woodsman"
// ProfessionString :
"P313988157" "Soul of the Wood"
// DescriptionString :
"P2812038289" "The Woodsman was once a renowned hero who helped keep the world of mankind in balance with the forces of nature, fighting against those who would destroy or corrupt nature for their own ends. He came to a tragic end when he was captured by the Devouring Earth, who used his link with the earth to destroy Woodvale and carve out their own territories. Though the Woodsman's physical body perished at the hands of the Devouring Earth, his spirit was freed through the actions of the city's heroes. Now he lives on as a spirit of nature, at one with the wild places of the Earth, helping heroes carry on the fight for the safety of the world."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2795972436" "I don't talk to villains, {HeroName}."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P2888409790" "Freeing me from the Devouring Earth has slowed the Hamidon's plans, but I fear it has not stopped them. Above all, the Devouring Earth seek the power to bend nature to their will; with me gone, they have sought out other victims. The creatures have taken several heroes with strong ties to nature, and will soon try to devour them. The heroes are held in an underground lair, guarded by a giant Crystal Titan. Those heroes must be rescued. I hope you will aid me in this task. Before you can begin, you must throw the Devouring Earth off balance. Will you strike against the Devouring Earth? Will you put them under the Wild Hunt and leave them reeling and afraid?"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P657867519" "This will be a perilous fight. Perhaps you can help me when you reach Security Level 39. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 39. If they are over Level 41, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 41 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P1314999064" "Your great skills will be put to better use elsewhere. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 39. If they are over Level 41, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 41 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P1338605778" "You cannot brave these dangers alone. Come back with at least three other heroes. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 39. If they are over Level 41, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 41 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2791426519" "I must speak with your team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3246654011" "When the entire team has arrived, I will tell you what I know."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P205947607" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 39. If they are over Level 41, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 41 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
